Author: t <t@t>
Date:   Sat Aug 15 11:14:59 2026 -0400

    verify: name the files a failed coverage check is missing
    
    Check 6 fails with a bare percentage today, which tells a reviewer
    the floor was missed but not where. On a test-heavy diff the number
    alone invites gaming (paste up to 60%) instead of closing the gap, so
    the failure now lists the files holding the largest uncovered line
    counts, and a comment records why the floor deliberately counts test
    lines: tests do not test themselves, so a test-heavy diff is exactly
    where a reviewer must show they read the test body.
    
    Signed-off-by: Minxi Hou <houminxi@gmail.com>

